  "text_sample": "Under10Archive \u2014 Music video research and archive Under10Archive is an independent platform for music video research, archival work, and curatorial programming. It explores the history of music videos across territories, documenting the directors, works, and local scenes that have shaped the format beyond the established canon. Through an international online archive, the project traces music video history from its earliest days to the present, connecting works with their creators, collaborators, and cultural contexts. 69 days, 12 hours, 44 minutes and 11 seconds to go. 69d 12h 44\u2019 11\u201d Under10Archive opens to the public on 27.01.2027. Subscribe for news and updates before the launch. Email Subscribe Subscribe Instagram FOCUS : SPAIN Under10archive presents \u2018VIDEOCLIP ESPA\u00d1OL: ANDALUC\u00cdA\u2019 FOCUS is an annual territorial research programme exploring the history of music videos across different countries, their directors, works, local scenes, and sociocultural contexts. Combining archival research with interviews, articles, screenings, and public events in collaboration with cultural institutions, each edition documents both established figures and lesser-known creators, contributing to",
